# ============================================
# SimpleAgent - 项目级 .dockerignore
# 构建上下文: 项目根目录 (.)
# ============================================

# --- Git & VCS ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.gitlab
.svn
.hg
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo

# --- 环境与密钥 ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# --- Node 依赖 (镜像内重新安装) ---
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/.pnpm-store

# --- 构建产物 ---
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/.turbo
**/.parcel-cache
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- 日志与临时文件 ---
**/*.log
**/logs
**/tmp
**/temp
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# --- 文档与报告 (对运行无意义) ---
**/*.md
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
!frontend/README.md
docs/
test-results/
test-output/
test-screenshots/
screenshots/
dogfood-output/
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.svg.bak
**/*.pdf
**/*.puml

# --- 测试相关 ---
**/test
**/tests
**/__tests__
**/coverage
**/jest.config.*
**/jest.setup.js
**/vitest.config.*
**/playwright.config.*
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright
**/test-data
**/test-results
**/test-*.js
**/test-*.cjs
**/test-*.mjs
**/check-*.cjs
**/check-*.js
**/verify-*.js
**/*-test.js
**/*-test.cjs
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.js
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx

# --- Docker 自身 ---
**/Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile.*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yaml
**/.dockerignore
docker/

# --- 数据与运行时产物 ---
**/data/
**/workspace/
**/plugins/
**/prisma/
**/prisma.config.ts
**/coverage/
**/2026-*
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
**/*.orig

# --- CI/CD & 工具配置 ---
.claude/
.omc/
.hooks/
.cursorrules
.cursor/
.aider*
.mcp.json
.eslintcache
.eslintignore
**/eslint.config.*
**/commitlint.config.*
**/lint-staged.config.*

# --- 性能/分析报告 ---
**/*-REPORT.md
**/*-REPORT.json
**/*-report.md
**/*-report.json
**/PERFORMANCE-*
**/BUNDLE-*
**/test-output/

# --- 后端特殊排除 (前端构建) ---
# 注意: 这里不能用 frontend/ 排除, 因为前端 Dockerfile 需要 frontend/ 源码
# 但后端 Dockerfile 只需要 backend/, 所以后端 Dockerfile 内显式只 COPY backend/

# --- 前端特殊排除 (后端构建) ---
# frontend/ 在后端构建时完全不需要
# 但本 .dockerignore 是通用的, 实际后端/前端 Dockerfile 各自精准 COPY

# --- 根目录的杂项 ---
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
image_001.jpg
conversation-view.png
overview.puml
check_*.cjs
test-components/
test-output/
